Package: paladin-save-sheets
Status: install ok installed
Priority: optional
Section: x11
Maintainer: palOS <joe.lucas0413@gmail.com>
Architecture: amd64
Version: 1.0.1
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: compact Save sheets for every program
 Save dialogs open small, as on the Mac: the file name and a "Where:" menu
 of the usual places (Desktop, Documents, Downloads ...) ending in
 "Someplace Else…"; the disclosure button opens the full folder browser.
 A GTK 3 module loaded by the Paladin session. Programs that use the GTK
 desktop portal for their dialogs (Electron, Chromium, Firefox, GTK 4,
 Flatpak) get the same compact sheet. Set PALADIN_FULL_SAVE=1 to turn it off
 for one program.
